{"4261320":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"스페셜포스 리마스터","steam_appid":4261320,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/05399051325e94e7c84b45f4877a3c8e.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/05399051325e94e7c84b45f4877a3c8e.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/05399051325e94e7c84b45f4877a3c8e.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPECIAL FORCE REMASTERED<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Once again, we are Special Force.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/455bb028a50a85ad5d0c7161a4a8651b.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/455bb028a50a85ad5d0c7161a4a8651b.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/455bb028a50a85ad5d0c7161a4a8651b.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/63cbd992972e7b22c35a1c2566577462.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/63cbd992972e7b22c35a1c2566577462.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/63cbd992972e7b22c35a1c2566577462.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic team-based FPS known for fast movement and precise gunplay returns to a new battlefield.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Force Remastered carries forward the fast-paced combat and distinctive gameplay flow of the original, reborn with modern visuals and new combat systems.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the battlefield as a special forces operative, and secure victory through quick decisions, precise control, and teamwork.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT’S NOT OLD. IT’S CLASSIC.<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic combat is classic for a reason.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/5b3a38ca9c60a9def1797ab58099c861.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/5b3a38ca9c60a9def1797ab58099c861.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/5b3a38ca9c60a9def1797ab58099c861.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a17b19c01765d4939defabef66f4ffba.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a17b19c01765d4939defabef66f4ffba.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a17b19c01765d4939defabef66f4ffba.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you know the map, the more ways you can approach each firefight.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise movement. Split-second shot timing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tension of combat, where a single quick decision can turn the tide.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Force Remastered preserves the fast, intuitive combat feel and gameplay flow that defined the original.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, but with greater depth to discover as your skills grow.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR BATTLE<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the battlefield your way.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/d1d5da5c0f26b979c546489433f4947f.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/d1d5da5c0f26b979c546489433f4947f.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/d1d5da5c0f26b979c546489433f4947f.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/88a29c86177f76de7c6db1d8a6e63827.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/88a29c86177f76de7c6db1d8a6e63827.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/88a29c86177f76de7c6db1d8a6e63827.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From fast-paced firefights focused on eliminating the enemy to tactical battles where teams work together to complete objectives, each mode offers a different way to fight.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEAM MISSION<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb · Capture · Escape<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack or defend as you complete objectives or eliminate the opposing team.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEAM DEATHMATCH<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with your team, take down more enemies, and claim victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FREE FOR ALL<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skill on a battlefield where every other player is an enemy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNIPER<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide the battle with one precise shot and split-second judgment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> <\/i><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHANGE THE BATTLE<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New choices that can change the course of battle.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/3aa9dc0800a6155cc4a57ac5189e9f12.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/3aa9dc0800a6155cc4a57ac5189e9f12.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/3aa9dc0800a6155cc4a57ac5189e9f12.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/44207297aea16ea7899a09ecd7e077d0.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/44207297aea16ea7899a09ecd7e077d0.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/44207297aea16ea7899a09ecd7e077d0.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every battle is decided by gunfire alone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use drones to locate enemies or engage them directly, and break through fortified defenses with the RPG-7.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy tactical equipment suited to the situation, including reconnaissance support and healing injectors, to seize the initiative for your team.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One choice can change the course of battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR WEAPON<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a weapon that fits the way you fight.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/c2f1f5c44201922781a201b8f9657b80.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/c2f1f5c44201922781a201b8f9657b80.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/c2f1f5c44201922781a201b8f9657b80.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your weapons through combat and unlock a variety of weapon parts.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine sights, muzzles, stocks, and other parts to build a weapon tailored to your playstyle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the same weapon can take on different characteristics and roles depending on the parts you choose.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROVE YOUR SKILL<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let your skill speak for itself.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/78f7a28affe338479af51a2cb1d1eff9.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/78f7a28affe338479af51a2cb1d1eff9.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/78f7a28affe338479af51a2cb1d1eff9.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep winning and challenge yourself to climb higher.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a skill-based tier system and refined matchmaking, you can compete against players of similar skill and push your limits.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through each season, claim victory, and rise to higher tiers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the highest level of competition, prove that you have what it takes to be Special Force.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR BATTLE. YOUR STYLE.<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You decide how you look on the battlefield.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a1f526a2d8c9b7651fe480dd92d80c05.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a1f526a2d8c9b7651fe480dd92d80c05.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a1f526a2d8c9b7651fe480dd92d80c05.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your individuality on the battlefield with a variety of customization options, including characters and weapon skins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome of battle is determined by your skill, not by what you buy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your style freely, and compete through skill, teamwork, and tactical judgment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> <\/i><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WE ARE SPECIAL FORCE.<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ths Classic fell of combat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New tactics. New competition.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Special Force begins again.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the new battlefield now.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPECIAL FORCE REMASTERED<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/05399051325e94e7c84b45f4877a3c8e.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/05399051325e94e7c84b45f4877a3c8e.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/05399051325e94e7c84b45f4877a3c8e.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPECIAL FORCE REMASTERED<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Once again, we are Special Force.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/455bb028a50a85ad5d0c7161a4a8651b.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/455bb028a50a85ad5d0c7161a4a8651b.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/455bb028a50a85ad5d0c7161a4a8651b.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/63cbd992972e7b22c35a1c2566577462.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/63cbd992972e7b22c35a1c2566577462.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/63cbd992972e7b22c35a1c2566577462.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic team-based FPS known for fast movement and precise gunplay returns to a new battlefield.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Force Remastered carries forward the fast-paced combat and distinctive gameplay flow of the original, reborn with modern visuals and new combat systems.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the battlefield as a special forces operative, and secure victory through quick decisions, precise control, and teamwork.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT’S NOT OLD. IT’S CLASSIC.<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic combat is classic for a reason.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/5b3a38ca9c60a9def1797ab58099c861.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/5b3a38ca9c60a9def1797ab58099c861.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/5b3a38ca9c60a9def1797ab58099c861.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a17b19c01765d4939defabef66f4ffba.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a17b19c01765d4939defabef66f4ffba.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a17b19c01765d4939defabef66f4ffba.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you know the map, the more ways you can approach each firefight.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise movement. Split-second shot timing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tension of combat, where a single quick decision can turn the tide.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Force Remastered preserves the fast, intuitive combat feel and gameplay flow that defined the original.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, but with greater depth to discover as your skills grow.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR BATTLE<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the battlefield your way.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/d1d5da5c0f26b979c546489433f4947f.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/d1d5da5c0f26b979c546489433f4947f.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/d1d5da5c0f26b979c546489433f4947f.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/88a29c86177f76de7c6db1d8a6e63827.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/88a29c86177f76de7c6db1d8a6e63827.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/88a29c86177f76de7c6db1d8a6e63827.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From fast-paced firefights focused on eliminating the enemy to tactical battles where teams work together to complete objectives, each mode offers a different way to fight.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEAM MISSION<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb · Capture · Escape<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack or defend as you complete objectives or eliminate the opposing team.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEAM DEATHMATCH<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with your team, take down more enemies, and claim victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FREE FOR ALL<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skill on a battlefield where every other player is an enemy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNIPER<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide the battle with one precise shot and split-second judgment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> <\/i><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHANGE THE BATTLE<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New choices that can change the course of battle.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/3aa9dc0800a6155cc4a57ac5189e9f12.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/3aa9dc0800a6155cc4a57ac5189e9f12.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/3aa9dc0800a6155cc4a57ac5189e9f12.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/44207297aea16ea7899a09ecd7e077d0.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/44207297aea16ea7899a09ecd7e077d0.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/44207297aea16ea7899a09ecd7e077d0.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every battle is decided by gunfire alone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use drones to locate enemies or engage them directly, and break through fortified defenses with the RPG-7.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy tactical equipment suited to the situation, including reconnaissance support and healing injectors, to seize the initiative for your team.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One choice can change the course of battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR WEAPON<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a weapon that fits the way you fight.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/c2f1f5c44201922781a201b8f9657b80.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/c2f1f5c44201922781a201b8f9657b80.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/c2f1f5c44201922781a201b8f9657b80.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your weapons through combat and unlock a variety of weapon parts.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine sights, muzzles, stocks, and other parts to build a weapon tailored to your playstyle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the same weapon can take on different characteristics and roles depending on the parts you choose.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROVE YOUR SKILL<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let your skill speak for itself.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/78f7a28affe338479af51a2cb1d1eff9.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/78f7a28affe338479af51a2cb1d1eff9.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/78f7a28affe338479af51a2cb1d1eff9.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep winning and challenge yourself to climb higher.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a skill-based tier system and refined matchmaking, you can compete against players of similar skill and push your limits.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through each season, claim victory, and rise to higher tiers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the highest level of competition, prove that you have what it takes to be Special Force.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR BATTLE. YOUR STYLE.<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You decide how you look on the battlefield.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a1f526a2d8c9b7651fe480dd92d80c05.poster.avif?t=1789720235\" width=1170 height=514 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a1f526a2d8c9b7651fe480dd92d80c05.webm?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/extras\/a1f526a2d8c9b7651fe480dd92d80c05.mp4?t=1789720235\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your individuality on the battlefield with a variety of customization options, including characters and weapon skins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome of battle is determined by your skill, not by what you buy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your style freely, and compete through skill, teamwork, and tactical judgment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> <\/i><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WE ARE SPECIAL FORCE.<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ths Classic fell of combat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New tactics. New competition.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Special Force begins again.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the new battlefield now.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPECIAL FORCE REMASTERED<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Special Force Returns! A classic team-based FPS bringing elite special forces from around the world together. Fast movement, impactful gunplay, and round-based tactical equipment create unpredictable battles where teamwork leads to victory.","supported_languages":"Korean, English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/2854aa643784cc2e7cb35cfd0e4dfc10356ba309\/header.jpg?t=1789720235","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/58f8b48413ec7c3c51425cebe70365db37e521e4\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1789720235","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/58f8b48413ec7c3c51425cebe70365db37e521e4\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1789720235","website":"https:\/\/sfr.dfl.co.kr\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> AMD Ryzen™ 5 1400 or Intel® Core™ i5-6600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1070 [VRAM : 8GB] <br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 20 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> AMD Ryzen™ 5 1600X or Intel® Core™ i7-6700K<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong>  Nvidia GeforceGTX 1080Ti or RTX 3060<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 25 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["DRAGONFLY GF CO., LTD."],"publishers":["DRAGONFLY GF CO., LTD."],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":35,"description":"In-App Purchases"},{"id":66,"description":"Color Alternatives"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":70,"description":"Surround Sound"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/c7aee6406eeb7b531be5984f8f4c99f15c74b63a\/ss_c7aee6406eeb7b531be5984f8f4c99f15c74b63a.600x338.jpg?t=1789720235","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/c7aee6406eeb7b531be5984f8f4c99f15c74b63a\/ss_c7aee6406eeb7b531be5984f8f4c99f15c74b63a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789720235"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/061a68976d3df8d9c842212f0da113a74c4c17ee\/ss_061a68976d3df8d9c842212f0da113a74c4c17ee.600x338.jpg?t=1789720235","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/061a68976d3df8d9c842212f0da113a74c4c17ee\/ss_061a68976d3df8d9c842212f0da113a74c4c17ee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789720235"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/71c0cf8fed1edfdf6381f1194427a1d724534d70\/ss_71c0cf8fed1edfdf6381f1194427a1d724534d70.600x338.jpg?t=1789720235","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/71c0cf8fed1edfdf6381f1194427a1d724534d70\/ss_71c0cf8fed1edfdf6381f1194427a1d724534d70.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789720235"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/20ca3924dbeecd0e6672ad11b38a08dfcb33fa10\/ss_20ca3924dbeecd0e6672ad11b38a08dfcb33fa10.600x338.jpg?t=1789720235","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/20ca3924dbeecd0e6672ad11b38a08dfcb33fa10\/ss_20ca3924dbeecd0e6672ad11b38a08dfcb33fa10.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789720235"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/8f58085a495881e29867b1ca4fdc6a954f73236b\/ss_8f58085a495881e29867b1ca4fdc6a954f73236b.600x338.jpg?t=1789720235","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/8f58085a495881e29867b1ca4fdc6a954f73236b\/ss_8f58085a495881e29867b1ca4fdc6a954f73236b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789720235"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/78a34d27e85bdf0fc8058cf45c8f0b6a08931dc4\/ss_78a34d27e85bdf0fc8058cf45c8f0b6a08931dc4.600x338.jpg?t=1789720235","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/78a34d27e85bdf0fc8058cf45c8f0b6a08931dc4\/ss_78a34d27e85bdf0fc8058cf45c8f0b6a08931dc4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789720235"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/4a84210d02a17625fdc6a3658885d6dac663aa3d\/ss_4a84210d02a17625fdc6a3658885d6dac663aa3d.600x338.jpg?t=1789720235","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/4a84210d02a17625fdc6a3658885d6dac663aa3d\/ss_4a84210d02a17625fdc6a3658885d6dac663aa3d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789720235"},{"id":7,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/e61e1070156094ac0eb8d6374c8c888dba84e6e3\/ss_e61e1070156094ac0eb8d6374c8c888dba84e6e3.600x338.jpg?t=1789720235","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4261320\/e61e1070156094ac0eb8d6374c8c888dba84e6e3\/ss_e61e1070156094ac0eb8d6374c8c888dba84e6e3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789720235"}],"achievements":{"total":25,"highlighted":[{"icon":"f95f8eb0059f316f8e6830c769f9f362c74f1010.jpg","localized_name":"Classic Rookie","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Classic Rookie","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4261320\/f95f8eb0059f316f8e6830c769f9f362c74f1010.jpg"},{"icon":"571e5855e98ffcb9f0b16aaaafa34fd7c5de73b8.jpg","localized_name":"First Step into Competition","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"First Step into Competition","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4261320\/571e5855e98ffcb9f0b16aaaafa34fd7c5de73b8.jpg"},{"icon":"95110256402e59d5a3461cdda533b9cc6cfedcc4.jpg","localized_name":"Teamwork Rookie","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Teamwork Rookie","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4261320\/95110256402e59d5a3461cdda533b9cc6cfedcc4.jpg"},{"icon":"45745e5ec6f8b2de3c379cc50659f09897c242ac.jpg","localized_name":"I Do Just Fine Alone","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"I Do Just Fine Alone","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4261320\/45745e5ec6f8b2de3c379cc50659f09897c242ac.jpg"},{"icon":"708c213d24fe8f1c629dab1d2f19f2d804fbac3c.jpg","localized_name":"Heart-Pounding First Plant","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Heart-Pounding First Plant","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4261320\/708c213d24fe8f1c629dab1d2f19f2d804fbac3c.jpg"},{"icon":"c6397dead5d5e81854199db8970a563c07bc08f3.jpg","localized_name":"Whew, I Made It","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Whew, I Made It","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4261320\/c6397dead5d5e81854199db8970a563c07bc08f3.jpg"},{"icon":"bd3a96305cb6b16857052f3c1c6c5de595c85bcd.jpg","localized_name":"Let the Fireworks Begin!","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Let the Fireworks Begin!","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4261320\/bd3a96305cb6b16857052f3c1c6c5de595c85bcd.jpg"},{"icon":"97c36031aaa6149d08f000772d1f58f12ee204d4.jpg","localized_name":"Shout My Name!","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Shout My Name!","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4261320\/97c36031aaa6149d08f000772d1f58f12ee204d4.jpg"},{"icon":"7cde3656881c4ded28746dd694ba130a5139ac2b.jpg","localized_name":"Ace of the Team","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Ace of the Team","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4261320\/7cde3656881c4ded28746dd694ba130a5139ac2b.jpg"},{"icon":"a76899e365e6314e24636d618d5f55538b5185b4.jpg","localized_name":"Eternal Rival","archived":0,"hidden":0,"name":"Eternal Rival","path":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/community_assets\/images\/apps\/4261320\/a76899e365e6314e24636d618d5f55538b5185b4.jpg"}]},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"Sep 16, 2026"},"support_info":{"url":"","email":"sfr@dragonflygame.com"},"background":"https:\/\/store.akamai.steamstatic.com\/images\/storepagebackground\/app\/4261320?t=1789720235","background_raw":"https:\/\/store.akamai.steamstatic.com\/images\/storepagebackground\/app\/4261320?t=1789720235","content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains content that is not suitable for all ages, violent content accompanied by bloodstains."},"ratings":{"kgrb":{"rating":"19","descriptors":"폭력성","use_age_gate":"true","required_age":"19"},"dejus":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"14","required_age":"14","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Violência\nLinguagem imprópria"},"steam_germany":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"16","required_age":"16","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nSchimpfwörte"},"igrs":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"18","required_age":"18","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Interaksi Daring\nKekerasan\nPenggunaan bahasa"}}}}}